","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, August to September and September to October both landed at 50% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April ran 196% of normal on the middle, and April to May ran 171%.</p>"}
